ol profile for unknown unicast traffic\\n2. Then apply it to the specific interfaces\\n3. The values match the Huawei configuration (38400 bps CIR and 7200000 byte burst size)\\n4. The VLAN-specific aspect is implied through the interface configuration in Juniper's switching setup\", 'trans_template': 'set interfaces ge-1/0/0 unit 0 family ethernet-switching storm-control unknown-unicast SC_UNKNOWN_UC'}, {'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'set interfaces ge-2/0/0 unit 0 family ethernet-switching storm-control unknown-unicast SC_UNKNOWN_UC', 'parent_command': ['set interfaces [parameter1]'], 'root': 'set interfaces [parameter1]', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"Here's the translated Juniper equivalent command for the given Huawei configuration:\\n\\n##\\nset forwarding-options storm-control-profiles SC_UNKNOWN_UC interface all level 38400 bandwidth-limit 7200000\\nset interfaces ge-1/0/0 unit 0 family ethernet-switching storm-control unknown-unicast SC_UNKNOWN_UC\\nset interfaces ge-2/0/0 unit 0 family ethernet-switching storm-control unknown-unicast SC_UNKNOWN_UC\\n##\\n\\nNote: In Juniper:\\n1. We first create a storm control profile for unknown unicast traffic\\n2. Then apply it to the specific interfaces\\n3. The values match the Huawei configuration (38400 bps CIR and 7200000 byte burst size)\\n4. The VLAN-specific aspect is implied through the interface configuration in Juniper's switching setup\", 'trans_template': 'set interfaces ge-2/0/0 unit 0 family ethernet-switching storm-control unknown-unicast SC_UNKNOWN_UC'}]]": 1,
